fix(admin user): show pro phone (WhatsApp + call), reword search helper; cédula stays masked

- Phone now resolves from the professional record (whatsapp / call_phone /
  allow_phone_call added to the admin users API + type). A pro shows
  "WhatsApp: … · Llamada: …"; a separate call line is shown when set, otherwise
  the WhatsApp number is used for both. Clients still show profiles.phone.
  Numbers are prettified (8888-8888, +506 stripped).
- Search helper reworded so it no longer feels contradictory: search by name,
  email, or a FULL cédula; note clarifies the cédula is always shown masked.
- Cédula remains masked server-side via maskId (unchanged) — X-XXXX-1234.

